# Keep the build context small and OS-clean. netcoredbg is fetched fresh (linux)
# during publish, so don't ship the local (Windows) cache or build artifacts.
# The Dockerfile copies only global.json, nuget.config, the props files, src/ and
# tools/; everything else is excluded from the context.
**/bin/
**/obj/
tools/netcoredbg/
spike/
tests/
samples/
docs/
scripts/
deploy/
coverage-report/
**/TestResults/
dist/
.git/
.vs/
.github/
